# Check out text with LF on every OS. bin/mil, hooks, and checks run
# through their shebang under sh / python3, and a CRLF line breaks that.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Ledger records, fixtures, and evidence are compared byte for byte
# (evidence sha256, bad/good proofs). Never convert line endings there.
.make-it-lint/ledger/** -text
**/.make-it-lint/ledger/** -text
